            "review_title": "Review at The Paradise Restaurant & Coffee Ninh Binh",
            "review_text": "Darrentimothy\n49 contributions\n0\nGood food, lovely place and friendly staff\nAug 2022\nChanced upon this place in ninh binh and it is surprisingly good. Very fresh food too! Suitable for friends and family. Staff are very very friendly and helpful. One of the best restaurant in ninh binh.\n\nWe will come back again whenever we are at ninh binh..\n\n👍🏻👍🏻\nRead more\nWritten August 12, 2022\nThe Paradise Restaurant Ninh Binh\nDear Sir. Sincerely thank you very much for using the service at our restaurant. We hope to continue to serve you in the future.\nWritten October 19, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
