            "review_title": "Review at The Paradise Restaurant & Coffee Ninh Binh",
            "review_text": "Rico\n405 contributions\n0\nMy Kinda Place!\nOct 2019\nHigh class coffee and private dining experience restaurant! This was certainly my favorite place in Ninh Binh. We went back like 5 times for coffees, twice for breakfast and 2 times for dinner. The first dinner we had was on the 5th floor (Oh yeah, they have the whole building) in one of their luxury private dining suites. We chose the Peking Duck for 5 people. They served us like Kings and Queens with white glove attention. Even the Mgr. Mr.Tung helped carve the crispy roasted duck. Oh yes, we got on a first name bases with most of the staff. The 2nd time we dined on the 5th floor was to enjoy a sucking pig dinner. And it the mornings for breakfast we couldn’t not order their steak and eggs, Delicious! But, even better were their coffees and teas! They were above and beyond anything else we had in Ninh Binh. Cannot recommend this place higher. Wish I could post some pictures.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 14, 2019",
